      "claim": "Linezolid, which contains an oxazolidinone-type polar heterocycle and fluorophenyl motif, is rapidly and completely absorbed with approximately 100% absolute oral bioavailability, supporting high F.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    },
    {
      "card_ids": ["C14"],
      "claim": "Vorapaxar, a larger oral drug with fluorophenyl and heteroaryl features, has approximately 100% oral bioavailability, supporting high F for the query.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    }
  ],
  "confidence": "high",
  "decision_summary": "All high-transfer experimental analogues have absolute oral bioavailability well above the 20% threshold, and the closest structural analogue (delpazolid) is essentially completely bioavailable. The query is therefore predicted to have high oral bioavailability.",
