    "No direct human pharmacokinetic data are available for the query molecule itself.",
    "The closest analogue's bioavailability data were not explicitly collected under fasted conditions, though its F is near 100%.",
    "The query's larger triazole-biaryl substituent could alter solubility or transporter behavior, but no evidence indicates low bioavailability."
  ],
